### Overview
Build a professional contact page with a validated form that sends emails to `founder@popuplane.com` via Resend, and update all contact touchpoints throughout the site to use this page.

---

## Phase 1: Create Contact Page Edge Function (20 min)

**File: `supabase/functions/send-contact-form/index.ts`**

**Functionality:**
- Accept POST requests with contact form data
- Validate input using zod schemas (name, email, subject, message, inquiry_type)
- Send formatted email to `founder@popuplane.com` using Resend
- Include security measures: input validation, rate limiting consideration
- Return success/error responses with proper CORS headers

**Email Structure:**
- **From:** "PopUp Lane Contact Form "
- **To:** founder@popuplane.com
- **Subject:** `[PopUp Lane] ${inquiry_type}: ${subject}`
- **HTML Body:** Professional template with:
  - Inquiry type badge (color-coded by type)
  - Sender details (name, email)
  - Subject line
  - Message content
  - Reply CTA button with mailto link
  - Footer with timestamp

**Inquiry Types:**
1. "General Question" (default)
2. "Merchant Application Support"
3. "Technical Issue"
4. "Partnership Inquiry"
5. "Billing & Payments"
6. "Feature Request"
7. "Other"

**Validation Rules:**
- Name: 2-100 characters, trim whitespace
- Email: Valid email format, max 255 characters
- Subject: 5-200 characters, required
- Message: 10-2000 characters, required
- Inquiry type: Must be one of the predefined types

