## Technical Decisions Explained

### Why Separate Edge Function?
- Keeps email sending server-side (secure)
- Hides Resend API key from frontend
- Allows server-side validation
- Can implement rate limiting
- Easier to add CRM integration later

### Why React Hook Form + Zod?
- Type-safe validation
- Already used in other parts of app (consistency)
- Excellent error handling
- Performance optimized (minimal re-renders)
- Accessible by default

### Why Not Use mailto: Links?
- Poor user experience (opens mail client)
- No validation or error handling
- Can't track submissions
- No spam protection
- Looks less professional

### Why Create Separate Components?
- Reusability (can use ContactForm in modals)
- Easier to maintain
- Follows single responsibility principle
- Can test in isolation

